      },
      "message": "fix(import): resolve OBJ face references against vertex records\n\nThe OBJ reader merged duplicate vertex positions and then resolved face\nreferences against the shortened unique list. A legal file that repeats\na vertex record was refused (\"vertex reference '5' out of range\"), and a\nreference in range of the short list could name the wrong position.\n\nThe reader now keeps one entry per `v` record that maps to its unique\nposition. Positive and negative references resolve against the records\nread so far. Out-of-range, zero and past-the-start references are still\nrefused by line.\n\nFixes #3298\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
